Harness is a separate project by DeepSeek, licensed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

Phone DSH is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by DeepSeek. The
name "DeepSeek Harness" and the DeepSeek marks belong to their owners and are
used here only to describe what this project runs.

The worker image and the iOS app bundle redistribute third-party software,
including (non-exhaustive):

  - DeepSeek Harness and its packages        MIT
  - Cordis (cordis, cosmokit)                MIT, Shigma
  - just-bash                                Apache-2.0
  - QuickJS                                  MIT, Fabrice Bellard
  - Google Sign-In for iOS and its SDK dependencies (AppAuth, App Check,
    GTMAppAuth, GTMSessionFetcher, GoogleUtilities, Interop, Promises)
                                              Apache-2.0
